                                                "sense_id": "cebacd95-2dc5-3ff9-9e34-4f7d1adc472e",
                                                "text": "Adult criteria are inappropriate for infants, but it was found that Dutch doctors sometimes do actively end the life of a child with the specific consent of the parents; a recent survey revealed that as many as 45% of neotologists and intensivists had intentionally done so."
